OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 11, held after racist word
OL,4,Ascrawled on child's forehead
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 11-year-old boy has been arrested as
OL,7,Fpart of an investigation into an
OL,8,Falleged racially motivated assault on a
OL,9,Fchild of six.
OL,11,FLancashire Police said a "racist word
OL,12,Fhad been written on [the boy's
OL,13,Fforehead] with a marker pen" during an
OL,14,Fincident at Harpers Recreation Ground
OL,15,Fin Chorley on Saturday.
OL,17,FThe force also revealed a slide in the
OL,18,Fplay area was graffitied with "an
OL,19,Foffensive word".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
