OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 11, held after racist word
OL,4,Ascrawled on child's forehead
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 11-year-old boy, who was arrested
OL,7,Fon suspicion of racially aggravated
OL,8,Fassault and racially aggravated
OL,9,Fcriminal damage, has been bailed
OL,10,Fpending further enquiries.
